{"message":"I can help with that. First, I need to verify your account. Please provide the email on your order (or your first and last name plus ZIP code). Also share the order number for the camera and confirm whether it has been delivered yet.

Once verified, I’ll check the camera model on your order and find the highest‑resolution waterproof option within the same price for that same model. Note: exchanges can only be to another option of the same camera model; if you prefer a different model, we can request a return instead.

If there’s any price difference, which payment method should I use (your original payment method or an existing gift card)?"}
